    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50810" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vī^brābĭlis</span></b> ,
			e, adj.
		vibro. * <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>That may be brandished</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ornus (i. e. hasta),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Aus. Ep. 24, 108</span></i>
			.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Quivering</i>, <i>glimmering</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sidus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart. Cap. 1, § 29</span></i>
			.</div>
